    <description>This package is deprecated as of Studio 23.10. 
Integration Service Connectors can now be used directly from the Project's Activities panel or Package Manager under All Connectors.

THIS VERSION REQUIRES THE PREVIEW CLOUD INTEGRATION SERVICE. UiPath Integration Service based automation activities for Freshservice. These activities allow you to execute create, retrieve, update and delete operations on Freshservice objects.</description>
